// AREA isles: the three beacons light the shrine door; Admin Nyx is waiting
// inside (isles.shrineNyx). The sealed door is an entry in
// lore/isles/sunport.lute.

## The door

::bg{location="sunfall-shrine" time="night"}
::music{playback="change" mood="eerie" volume="down"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Three shafts of light fall through three slots in the ceiling and meet on the shrine door. It opens without a sound.
@narrator{code="0020" when="entry.islesTablet3.read"}: The third tablet was right: "When the three fires meet, the door remembers."
@duskAdminNyx{code="0010" emotion="smug"}: So the Champion does errands now. Thank you for lighting my way in.
